msgid "Generates a unique WooCommerce coupon based on a template coupon"
msgstr "Genera un cupón único de WooCommerce basado en un cupón plantilla"

#: lite/language.php:1743
#: pro/workflows/variables/coupon-generate-unique-coupon.php:22
msgid ""
"Name of the coupon that will cloned. NOTE: Don't delete the coupon code in "
